WEBVTT

00:29:29.996 --> 00:29:33.496
And, you know, to go and discover
not only the chimps use tools,

00:29:33.663 --> 00:29:38.246
but even make their own. I'm interested
in how you, I guess,

00:29:38.246 --> 00:29:41.121
kept such an open mind to discover
things that flew in

00:29:41.121 --> 00:29:42.829
the face of what everyone
thought was true

00:29:43.079 --> 00:29:49.871
because I hadn't been college. You do.
I mean, that's what he told me later.

00:29:49.954 --> 00:29:52.954
He said I I wanted somebody
with an unbiased mind.

00:29:53.121 --> 00:29:57.913
And I don't like the way the reductions
thinking of scientists today.

00:29:57.996 --> 00:30:04.621
So he also felt that a woman might
be more patient on the field.